<div class="flex flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-4"><div><h1 class="text-[32px] font-extrabold tracking-tight">Rekomendasi diskon</h1><p class="mt-2 text-[13px] text-muted">Tinjau peluang diskon untuk stok lambat, sambil menjaga sisa margin.</p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5"><select id="per" aria-label="Periode" class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[13px] outline-none focus:border-brand"><option value="7">7 hari terakhir</option><option value="14">14 hari terakhir</option><option value="30">30 hari terakhir</option><option value="month">Bulan ini</option></select><select id="cover" aria-label="Batas stok berlebih" class="rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface px-3.5 py-2.5 text-[13px] outline-none focus:border-brand"><option value="7">Stok cukup &gt; 7 hari</option><option value="10" selected>Stok cukup &gt; 10 hari</option><option value="14">Stok cukup &gt; 14 hari</option><option value="21">Stok cukup &gt; 21 hari</option><option value="30">Stok cukup &gt; 30 hari</option></select></div></div>
