<div class="mt-5 grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_1.1fr]"><div><div class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"><div><label for="dPct" class="text-[12px] font-bold">Diskon yang ditinjau</label><div class="mt-2 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface px-3.5 py-3 text-[14px] focus-within:border-brand"><input id="dPct" type="number" min="1" max="50" step="1" inputmode="numeric" class="min-w-0 flex-1 bg-transparent outline-none"><span class="text-[13px] text-muted">%</span></div></div><div><p class="text-[12px] font-bold">Harga setelah diskon</p><div class="mt-2 flex items-center gap-3 rounded-lg border border-line bg-surface px-3.5 py-3 text-[14px] focus-within:border-brand"><span class="text-[13px] text-muted">Rp</span><span id="dPrice" class="flex-1"></span></div></div></div><p id="rvCalc" class="mt-3 text-[11px] leading-relaxed text-muted"></p><p class="mt-2 text-[11px] text-muted">Ingin menghitung dari target laba? <a id="rvPriceLink" href="/analisis-harga" class="font-bold text-brand hover:underline">Buka analisis harga</a>.</p></div>
<div><p class="text-[12px] font-bold">Mengapa produk ini disarankan?</p><p id="rvWhy" class="mt-3 text-[12px] leading-relaxed text-muted"></p><p id="rvMargin" class="mt-3 rounded-lg bg-canvas px-4 py-3 text-[12px] font-semibold"></p></div></div>
<div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-line pt-5"><label class="flex items-center gap-3 text-[12px] text-muted"><input id="ack" type="checkbox" class="size-4 accent-[#245c45]">Saya sudah meninjau usulan harga dan sisa margin produk ini.</label><div class="flex items-center gap-6"><button type="button" id="btnSkip" class="text-[13px] font-bold text-brand">Lewati</button><button type="button" id="btnApply" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg bg-brand px-4 py-2.5 text-[13px] font-bold text-white transition hover:bg-brand-dark disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-40"></button></div></div></section>
<section id="activeSec" class="mt-5 hidden overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-line bg-surface"><div class="p-6 pb-3"><h2 class="text-[18px] font-extrabold">Diskon yang sedang berjalan</h2><p class="mt-1 text-[12px] text-muted">Harga di Cek harga dan Produk &amp; stok sudah memakai harga diskon.</p></div><ul id="activeList" class="px-6 pb-3"></ul></section>
<p class="mt-6 flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] text-muted">Margin kotor = (harga setelah diskon – biaya perolehan) ÷ harga setelah diskon. Belum mengurangi beban operasional. Hanya pemilik atau pengguna berizin yang dapat menerapkan harga.</p>
